// font8x8.hex -- 8x8 font ROM image for $readmemh (Chapter 2.2).
//
// 128 glyphs for codes 0x00-0x7F, 8 bytes each, 1,024 bytes in all.
// Address = code * 8 + row; row 0 is the top. Bit 7 of each byte is the
// LEFTMOST pixel; a 1 bit is foreground. Codes below 0x20 and 0x7F are blank.
//
// Glyphs: font8x8_basic by Daniel Hepper (https://github.com/dhepper/font8x8),
// based on Marcel Sondaar's and IBM's public domain VGA fonts. License:
// public domain. Bit order reversed here (the original has bit 0 leftmost).
